what am I doing wrong ?

There is an issue with how the model is fetching the object.  It will always stay in the init state the object is made before the check. 
```
  async getIndividual(id) {
    let state = {state : PersonStore.STATE.INIT};
    if( state.state === 'init' ) {
      await this.service.getIndividual(id);
    } else if( state.state === 'loading' ) {
      await state.request;
    }
    return this.store.data.byIndividual[id];
  }
```
Change it so that it gets the item from the store and check for the current state.    
```
  async getIndividual(id) {
    let current = this.store.data.byIndividual[id];
    if( current && current.request ) {
      await current.request;
    } else {
      await this.service.getIndividual(id);
    }
    return this.store.data.byIndividual[id];
  }
```

